{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mYKEky6ANp1792877352.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>午夜過後多區有內地旅客等車過關，新皇崗口岸車龍一度長至新田交匯處。</p><p></p><p>從社交平台片段可見，凌晨時分通往皇崗口岸的新深路有長車龍，龍尾一度排至新田交匯處。在口岸旁的緩衝區，大批私家車排隊進口岸過關。根據入境處應用程式，大塞車時皇崗旅客過境通道，等候時間為15分鐘內。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268s8niZgFgF1792877349.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>而在旺角，前往皇崗的直通巴同樣大排長龍，要上車至少要等半小時。不少內地旅客都帶著萬聖節裝扮，亦有人指是看完演唱會，即晚回深圳。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OGkeRneD3n1792877346.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>深圳旅客楊小姐說：「我們今天看了一個演唱會，沒趕上(尾班)車，過了半小時，我以為不用等的。我沒坐過這輛車，還好吧，畢竟這麼晚可以理解。」</p><p></p><p>深圳旅客李女士稱：「我去了蘭桂坊，體驗過就不再來了，人太多了。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:24.619487+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:02.087560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:38:07.117825+00:00","content_hash":"5f195dd7cf1be1b99f57e7ea367ce93e73a6feaf96d4781acf3dc6b9fd299aaa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:24.619487+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}